Stressed Desserts.

Spell STRESSED into the first bowl, flip it pancake by pancake into the second, and it comes out as DESSERTS. Proof that stacks make everything better.

Ingredients.
68 g dates
69 g eggs
83 g sugar
82 g rosemary
84 g turnips
8 pinches patience
pancakes

Method.
Put dates into the mixing bowl. Put eggs into the mixing bowl. Put sugar into the mixing bowl. Put sugar into the mixing bowl. Put eggs into the mixing bowl. Put rosemary into the mixing bowl. Put turnips into the mixing bowl. Put sugar into the mixing bowl. Flip the patience. Fold pancakes into the mixing bowl. Put pancakes into the 2nd mixing bowl. Flip the patience until flipped. Liquefy contents of the 2nd mixing bowl. Pour contents of the 2nd mixing bowl into the baking dish.

Serves 1.
